&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;３．確定拠出制度&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;当社及び連結子会社の確定拠出制度への要拠出額は、前連結会計年度&lt;span&gt;326百万円&lt;/span&gt;、当連結会計年度&lt;span&gt;346百万円&lt;/span&gt;であります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11.5pt;font-size:11.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRetirementBenefitsConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesShareOptionsEtcConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:18pt;"&gt;(ストック・オプション等関係)&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:22.5pt;text-indent:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesShareOptionsEtcConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
